⍝ Run every STARMAP test, book and modern
⍝
⍝   dyalog -script test/run.apls        (from the repository root)
⍝
⍝ Loads APLSource/ as #.sm (book version) and Starmap/ as #.Starmap
⍝ (modern version, subfolders as child namespaces), sets
⍝ #.Starmap.Data←#.sm, runs #.Starmap.Initialise to set the constants,
⍝ then runs every TEST_* function in #.sm and every function in
⍝ #.Starmap.Tests.
⍝ STARMAP_EXTRA_TESTS names a further folder of tests for #.Starmap.Tests.
⍝ Prints one line per test and a summary; exits 0 only if all passed.

⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1

∇ ns Load dir;files;f;sub;n
⍝ Fix every source file in dir into ns; subfolders become child namespaces
  files←⊃0(⎕NINFO⍠1)dir,'/*'
  :For f :In files
      :Select 3⊃⎕NPARTS f
      :CaseList '.aplf' '.aplo' '.aplc' '.apln' '.apli'
          2 ns.⎕FIX'file://',f
      :Case '.apla'
          n←2⊃⎕NPARTS f
          ⍎'ns.',n,'←',∊(⊃⎕NGET f 1),¨' '
      :Case ''
          :If 1=1 ⎕NINFO f
              n←2⊃⎕NPARTS f
              sub←ns⍎n⊣n ns.⎕NS''
              sub Load f
          :EndIf
      :EndSelect
  :EndFor
∇

∇ r←ns Run name;label
⍝ Run one test; r is 1 if it passed
  label←(2↓⍕ns),'.',name
  :Trap 0
      r←1≡ns⍎name
      ⎕←((1+r)⊃'FAIL' 'PASS'),' ',label
  :Else
      r←0
      ⎕←'ERROR ',label,': ',⊃⎕DM
  :EndTrap
∇

∇ Main;root;extra;book;modern;results;code
  root←⊃1 ⎕NPARTS''
  '#.sm'⎕NS''
  #.sm Load root,'APLSource'
  '#.Starmap'⎕NS''
  #.Starmap Load root,'Starmap'
  #.Starmap.Data←#.sm
  :If 3=#.Starmap.⎕NC'Initialise'     ⍝ absent until stage 5 is implemented
      #.Starmap.Initialise
  :EndIf
  extra←2 ⎕NQ'.' 'GetEnvironment' 'STARMAP_EXTRA_TESTS'
  :If 0≠≢extra
      #.Starmap.Tests Load root,extra
  :EndIf
  book←{⍵/⍨'TEST_'∘≡¨5↑¨⍵}#.sm.⎕NL ¯3
  modern←#.Starmap.Tests.⎕NL ¯3
  results←(#.sm∘Run¨book),#.Starmap.Tests∘Run¨modern
  ⎕←(⍕+/results),' passed, ',(⍕+/~results),' failed'
  code←(1 0)[1+∧/results]   ⍝ an integer: ⎕OFF exits 0 when given a Boolean 1
  ⎕OFF code
∇

∇ Start
  :Trap 0
      Main
  :Else
      ⎕←'ERROR loading or running tests:' ⋄ ⎕←↑⎕DM
      ⎕OFF 2
  :EndTrap
∇

Start
